OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy for
OL,6,Fmuch of the night with a band of rain,
OL,7,Fheavy at times, slowly moving
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards. Becoming drier by dawn
OL,9,Fwith an easing wind and some clear
OL,10,Fspells developing into Friday morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cool start to the morning
OL,13,Funder largely clear skies. Becoming
OL,14,Fcloudier with the chance of some
OL,15,Fshowers developing during the
OL,16,Fafternoon, mainly over high ground and
OL,17,Falong the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
